[108.172617, "i", "cat > SYNC_FIX_SUMMARY.txt << 'EOF'\nMaven Mirror Sync Fix Summary\n==============================\n\nProblem:\n--------\nThe sync.sh script was failing with checksum mismatches on 3 jars:\n- auth-1.5.3.jar\n- cache-1.0.4.jar  \n- metrics-0.9.2.jar\n\nRoot Cause:\n-----------\nThe manifest.sha1 file contained stale/placeholder checksums (all zeros)\nfor these three artifacts instead of their actual SHA1 hashes.\n\nOld manifest entries:\n0000000000000000000000000000000000000001  auth-1.5.3.jar\n0000000000000000000000000000000000000002  cache-1.0.4.jar\n0000000000000000000000000000000000000003  metrics-0.9.2.jar\n\nSolution:\n---------\nRegenerated manifest.sha1 by downloading the correct checksums from Nexus.\nNexus provides .sha1 files alongside each jar (standard Maven practice).\n\nNew manifest entries:\n656d27f8f42c17585f635b500aa895a338940dfd  auth-1.5.3.jar\n9d2fcbca66615234ff89eda4fa4c4075d3856c0c  cache-1.0.4.jar\ne398e244ce04e6e7e51d94b9b9a550309454ffbd  metrics-0.9.2.jar\n\nResult:\n-------\nSync now completes successfully with all "]
[108.172751, "i", "checksums verified.\nBackup of old manifest saved as manifest.sha1.backup.\n\nFuture Prevention:\n------------------\nWhen adding new artifacts to artifacts.list, ensure manifest.sha1\nis updated with correct checksums from Nexus (download .sha1 files).\nEOF\n"]
